## Test File Naming

| Pattern | Example |
|---------|---------|
| Unit tests | `{ComponentName}.test.tsx` |
| Integration tests | `{ComponentName}.integration.test.tsx` |
| Visual tests | `{ComponentName}.visual.test.tsx` |
